@page "/"

<PageTitle>BevTools lazy loading sample</PageTitle>

<h1>Lazy loading</h1>

<p>
    This app ships BevTools without anyone downloading it: the browser has <code>Bit.BevTools.Loader.wasm</code>, not
    <code>Bit.BevTools.wasm</code>. Press <strong>Open dev tools</strong> and the loader downloads it, attaches it to
    the running app and opens its panel, which lists the components that already exist and sees everything from then
    on - try the <a href="counter">counter</a>.
</p>
